1
00:00:04,567 --> 00:00:08,935
One command. A real desktop app.

2
00:00:09,202 --> 00:00:11,013
Sign in with GitHub.

3
00:00:11,063 --> 00:00:14,399
Connect your Claude.

4
00:00:14,449 --> 00:00:18,179
Pick your repos.

5
00:00:18,779 --> 00:00:23,661
Review requests land in your queue.

6
00:00:24,261 --> 00:00:41,599
Claude drafts the review
from the real diff.

7
00:00:41,866 --> 00:00:50,522
You pick what's worth saying.

8
00:00:50,572 --> 00:00:54,061
Posted under your name.
Nothing posts until you click.

9
00:00:54,561 --> 00:01:00,584
Scan once.
Your phone is signed in.

10
00:01:01,084 --> 00:01:07,276
Review from anywhere.

11
00:01:07,326 --> 00:01:17,140
Swipe to keep.

12
00:01:17,640 --> 00:01:23,190
It learns what your team drops.
